Flow: agent_device.rs → embedd_handler.rs ← rfid_nfc_rag_chaining.rs
RFID tag ──► [two ingest paths] ──► Qdrant (vec 384d) ──► quickThink query ──► LLM ──► result


Role of each file
File	Role	Entry Point
rfid_nfc_rag_chaining.rs	Direct reader path — scan → validate → position → insight → store	comprehensive_scan()
agent_device.rs	FIWARE path — subscribe/poll → parse NGSI → embed → upsert Qdrant	process_notification() / poll_and_sync()
embedd_handler.rs	Query router — receives user request, routes to correct pipeline, returns LLM response	quickThink()


rfid_nfc_rag_chaining = direct hardware path (use case aware: ValuablesTracking, JewelryInventory, SupplyChain, etc.)
agent_device = network path via FIWARE broker (IoT platform integration)
embedd_handler = the query side — both ingest paths write to the same Qdrant, so quickThink retrieves from either source transparently